# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile (context: repository root).
# The build needs go.mod, go.sum, cmd/, internal/, the embedded files under
# web/dashboard/ and docs/guidelines/, and LICENSE. Keep those.
# Patterns are anchored at the context root; **/ matches in any directory.

# Version control, CI and editor state
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
.mcp.json

# Local secrets and environment files (the binary loads .env from its
# working directory, so never send one into the build)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/database-url
**/ops-token

# Node and web build output
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
web/dashboard/dist
web/dashboard/.vite

# Built binaries and test artefacts
dist
toolyard
gateway
gateway-*
cmd/gateway/gateway
**/*.exe
**/*.so
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.prof

# Local data: SQLite databases, data directories, temporary files
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.toolyard.db*
data
tmp

# Not needed to build the binary
docs/assets
docs/research
deploy/stage
